  "content": "\n\n<pre style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/DyM7WJJL/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"670\"><br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Jz2HnS9J/TZP-LOGO-2023.png\" alt=\"TZP LOGO\" width=\"1280\" height=\"380\"><br></strong></pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Tissou的Minecraft僵尸包（版本1.7至1.20）</strong></span></p>\n<p>Tissou的僵尸包极大地丰富了Minecraft僵尸的视觉与听觉多样性。</p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">功能特点：</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>超过1500种不同皮肤</strong>：每只僵尸都独一无二，为你的探索之旅带来无限变化与惊喜。</li>\n<li><strong>数百种全新音效</strong>：多变的呻吟与哀嚎，营造出更加沉浸且恐怖的氛围。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">最佳使用方式：</span></h3>\n<p>为了充分体验种类繁多的僵尸，需要安装<strong>Optifine</strong>或功能等同的模组。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">兼容性说明：</span></h3>\n<p>Tissou的僵尸包仅修改僵尸、僵尸村民、尸壳和溺尸。只要将其置于你的资源包列表最前方，即可与任何其他资源包配合使用。</p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">推荐搭配：</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245476932305293342/image.png?ex=6658e448&is=665792c8&hm=4a25878b15a53cd1d3ce7045823114cdb40368ad0f64e2c5992457ca888342aa&\" alt=\"Optifine\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245476908854935603/image.png?ex=6658e442&is=665792c2&hm=4f776018f6b8cbacec0058d5b5a4bdaf5ad66e888b099bd411461a0d5c9c3713&\" alt=\"[ETF] 实体纹理特性\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a>&nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245477606829199462/a49a324c9210aaf7f5899199af2eaf6ff345b4ef.webp?ex=6658e4e9&is=66579369&hm=7ff1d28666b2d1866b2cdb0aa4605dc965812da0e257f96ecf6c64a0584892e4&\" alt=\"Fresh Animations\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classic-guns-tac\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245477965656096838/3d15118d02b333b8d8ca5be6a2070ff69d2c0d71.png?ex=6658e53e&is=665793be&hm=9d8210b6f84164f628f5c50b01a8ac1a896b41c66c1dbffa35a1f61625ac9ac7&\" alt=\"Timeless and Classics Guns\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-awareness\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245478607057584138/images.jpg?ex=6658e5d7&is=66579457&hm=cc9c96043d4cdbc80b74310cc67b9321fd61b7c4a03f3730bcd8ad45e92bf109&\" alt=\"Zombie Awareness\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245480295252230267/636320465430890063.png?ex=6658e76a&is=665795ea&hm=d0d12b5071eeaa155b7f7e15f6196554f7b96f8aa2cb5b5be400de2940996592&\" alt=\"The Lost Cities\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-sunscreen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245482592703352853/637756076157485832.png?ex=6658e98e&is=6657980e&hm=66b033de75c7b0ab156e0ef0c7359e0e216de30ca4b924bde1731c1da78c09af&\" alt=\"下载生物防晒霜\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a></p>\n<p><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4YRcJZhSmfo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</pre>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252fassaderie\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Vv7smR1H/animated-b